$$------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ Secondary (Norton) creep, single element, constant load  --  Altair OptiStruct
$$
$$   units : mm - N - tonne - s   (stress MPa)
$$   model : 1 x 1 x 1 mm CHEXA, 1/8 symmetry, 100 N pulled on the x=1 face
$$           -> sigma_x = 100 MPa held for 1000 s
$$   law   : Norton   eps_dot_cr = A * sigma^M ,  A = 1e-15, M = 5
$$   check : creep strain after 1000 s = 0.01000, total ux = 0.0104762 mm
$$
$$   MATVP supplements MAT1 with the same MID, exactly like MATS1 does for
$$   plasticity.  Field order follows the MSC MATVP primary format
$$       MATVP MID A IT3D M N P Q IUSER
$$   with the law  eps_dot_cr = A * sigma^M * eps^N * t^P.
$$
$$   CONFIDENCE NOTE: Altair's MATVP field table is not machine readable, so
$$   this deck assumes OptiStruct mirrors the MSC layout (it does for MAT1,
$$   MATS1, MAT8, PCOMP, TABLES1).  Check the .out listing before trusting it.
$$
$$   Small displacement on purpose -- no PARAM,LGDISP.  At 1% creep strain the
$$   section barely shrinks, and holding the stress at exactly 100 MPa is what
$$   makes the answer closed form.
$$------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ I/O Options
SCREEN,OUT
OUTPUT,H3D
DISPLACEMENT(H3D) = ALL
STRESS(H3D)       = ALL
STRAIN(H3D)       = ALL
SPCFORCE(H3D)     = ALL
$$
$$ Subcase Information
SUBCASE 1
  LABEL    = hold 100 N for 1000 s
  ANALYSIS = NLSTAT
  SPC      = 1
  LOAD     = 2
  NLPARM   = 10
$$
BEGIN BULK
$
$       ID      NINC    DT      KMETHOD KSTEP   MAXITER CONV
NLPARM  10      100     10.0    AUTO    5       25      UPW
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ MESH
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
GRID    1               0.0     0.0     0.0
GRID    2               1.0     0.0     0.0
GRID    3               1.0     1.0     0.0
GRID    4               0.0     1.0     0.0
GRID    5               0.0     0.0     1.0
GRID    6               1.0     0.0     1.0
GRID    7               1.0     1.0     1.0
GRID    8               0.0     1.0     1.0
$
CHEXA   1       1       1       2       3       4       5       6
+       7       8
$
PSOLID  1       1       0
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ MATERIAL   -- MATVP supplements the MAT1 with the same MID
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
MAT1    1       210000.         0.3     7.85-9
$
$       MID     A       IT3D    M       N       P       Q       IUSER
MATVP   1       1.0-15  0       5.0     0.0     0.0     0.0
$
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
$$ BOUNDARY CONDITIONS AND LOAD
$$-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
SPC1    1       1       1       4       5       8
SPC1    1       2       1       2       5       6
SPC1    1       3       1       2       3       4
$
$ 4 nodes x 25 N = 100 N over 1 mm2 = 100 MPa
$       SID     G       CID     F       N1      N2      N3
FORCE   2       2       0       25.0    1.0     0.0     0.0
FORCE   2       3       0       25.0    1.0     0.0     0.0
FORCE   2       6       0       25.0    1.0     0.0     0.0
FORCE   2       7       0       25.0    1.0     0.0     0.0
$
ENDDATA
